              <p class="tw:[margin-bottom:12px] tw:[line-height:1.7] tw:[color:var(--text-primary)]">The <strong class="tw:[color:var(--gold-bright)]">[C&amp;C] Vow Collar Suite</strong> is a modern, lag-free Second Life BDSM, FinDom, and RLV management system. Unlike older OpenCollar forks that rely on heavy HTTP polling or 50+ scripts, the Vow Collar runs entirely on optimized native LSL with <strong class="tw:[color:var(--gold-bright)]">LinksetData persistence</strong> and Second Life Experience auto-attach permissions.</p>
            </div>
