              </ul>
            </div></div><div class="card tw:[margin-bottom:28px]">
            <h2 class="card-title tw:[font-size:22px] tw:[margin-bottom:14px]">2. Quick Start &amp; Locking Protocols</h2>
            <div class="tw:[font-size:14.5px] tw:[color:var(--text-primary)] tw:[line-height:1.7]">
              <h4 class="tw:[font-size:16px] tw:[font-weight:700] tw:[color:var(--gold-bright)] tw:[margin:16px_0_6px]">Step 1: Wear the Collar &amp; Accept Permissions
Right-click &gt; Add the collar. When prompted to accept Experience permissions for 'Control &amp; Chaos', click <strong class="tw:[color:var(--gold-bright)]">Yes</strong>.</h4><h4 class="tw:[font-size:16px] tw:[font-weight:700] tw:[color:var(--gold-bright)] tw:[margin:16px_0_6px]">Step 2: Lock Ceremony &amp; Passkey Setup
Touch the collar or type <code class="tw:[font-family:var(--font-mono)] tw:[color:var(--gold-bright)] tw:[background:rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] tw:[padding:2px_6px] tw:[border-radius:4px] tw:[font-size:12px]">/22 menu</code>. Select <strong class="tw:[color:var(--gold-bright)]">Lock Collar</strong>. The wearer or Mistress sets a private 4-digit passkey.</h4><h4 class="tw:[font-size:16px] tw:[font-weight:700] tw:[color:var(--gold-bright)] tw:[margin:16px_0_6px]">Step 3: Direct Debit &amp; Air Tax Activation
In the <strong class="tw:[color:var(--gold-bright)]">FinDom &gt; Air Tax</strong> menu, the submissive grants debit permission. The Mistress can configure a daily or per-minute tax.</h4>
            </div>
          </div><div class="card tw:[margin-bottom:28px]">
